+
+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies a JSON Merge Patch from RFC 7386 and returns a new JSON value
+without changing either input. An object patch recursively merges its members into an object target;
+if the target is not an object, it is treated as an empty object. A `null` member removes that member
+from the target, while arrays and all other non-object patch values replace the target entirely.
